Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut it out already! I've already told you everything I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:21.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we're under Lt. Col. Archer's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:24.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that! \NI'm in a hurry here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.23,0:00:37.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Crimson Alchemist, Zolf J. Kimbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.95,0:00:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As well as the Sewing Life Alchemist, Shou Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:44.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've kept my end of the promise. \NNow for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.71,0:00:45.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:48.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will secure your safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.47,0:00:54.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or my name isn't Frank Archer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-My safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.67,0:00:59.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. You are going to return to the military
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.49,0:01:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and continue your research, directly beneath me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.98,0:01:05.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can continue my research?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:06.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:08.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Change of mission directives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:11.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy to anyone who opposes us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:15.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eliminate any troublemakers who are infesting this bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.40,0:01:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-But are you sure we should?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.03,0:01:18.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.91,0:01:21.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As long as I have Tucker,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:25.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can make as many of those \Nsorts of guys as I want to, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.87,0:01:29.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And Greed can't lay a hand on me \Nas long as I have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.99,0:01:35.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:40.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:45.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:42.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:43.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:48.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed-san, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.27,0:04:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My name is Alex Louis Armstrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:12.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People call me \Nthe Strong Arm Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:21.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will return...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:24.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse Elric to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:30.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My word... \NSloth sure is a slave driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:34.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then again, she was responsible for letting him escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:36.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I guess she has no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:40.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what will you do, Greed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:56.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is the artistic alchemy that has been passed down
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.86,0:04:59.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,among the Armstrong family for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:02.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look like you're going to be a tough customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:06.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to \Nmean business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:17.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How bizarre...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:07.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has been some time since my blood boiled and my muscles danced.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:10.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impressive, Armstrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.38,0:06:12.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your arms are as strong as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:19.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I also participated in the battle to exterminate Ishbal, as a grunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:21.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a former comrade?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:24.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I have even less desire to take your life needlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is too much to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:35.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major! Please stand aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.92,0:06:36.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:38.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not throw your lives away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:42.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're not going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.71,0:06:44.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:46.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell Kimbly and Tucker for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I will be sure \Nto return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He sure is quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:16.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,especially considering \Nhow loud he was earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.63,0:07:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must have grown \Ntired of carrying on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.49,0:07:21.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad he has, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:23.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:44.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So we're the only ones \Nwho got away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.35,0:07:49.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well then, what do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:55.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How long do you intend to keep running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:57.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it might be \Ntoo late for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:03.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've already seen \NGluttony here, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:09.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the current Lust.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:12.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:14.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To cut to the chase, Greed,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you've come to \Na fork in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.45,0:08:21.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can be sealed up again,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.14,0:08:22.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or you can be destroyed right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:26.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think I can be \Ndone in by you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:28.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You, a homunculus, \Nwere sealed up by a certain someone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:35.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,after rebelling 140 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That person is angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's about time we brought this to an end, Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:45.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An end! An end!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:54.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this, boy, \Nbut you'll have to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.71,0:08:56.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of Martel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roa-san... Dolcetto-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.05,0:09:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on, what's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.93,0:09:03.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please go, Greed-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:05.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:07.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't afford \Nto lose you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.85,0:09:17.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll leave it to you \Nto avenge us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:22.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure are keeping some loyal pawns, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.27,0:09:24.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been merged \Ntogether with a dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:27.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and dogs have a strong \Nsense of loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.89,0:09:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You cannot go beyond this point!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:35.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.89,0:09:37.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no use running.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:45.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can tuck tail \Nand run too, Dolcetto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.26,0:09:48.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to do just that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but these guys \Ntook a shot at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.49,0:09:53.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:54.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too late to back out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:04.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:06.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's where \NDante-san's house is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud, \Nyou sure are sociable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:20.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You had the chance to run \Nin the midst of all that trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.55,0:10:22.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:24.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter. Hey, Martel...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:28.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay inside there until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:34.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I'm not back by then, \Nyou get away by yourself. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed-san! \NWhat are you planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.56,0:10:38.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this, boy. \NThat's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:41.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me out! \NOpen up, I tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't! Greed-san \Nsaid not to come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:48.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:10:59.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I wound up \Ncoming back here after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.63,0:11:02.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder why my legs \Nbrought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:06.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do they want me to \Nbeg her for my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:17.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a good boy, Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is just as you-know-who thought it would unfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:22.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're done?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:25.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Our job is done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:27.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:44.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The reason you came here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:47.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is because this is your birthplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:49.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:14.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are those...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're your bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.81,0:12:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you? \NWhat did Dante tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.15,0:12:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's Dante-sama you want, \Nshe's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:37.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:42.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way a kid like you can do something like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:44.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is behind this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:48.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.20,0:12:55.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:14.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.68,0:13:16.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:46.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've found you, Greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.83,0:13:56.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dante-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:58.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:14:00.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:04.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good question. \NI'd like to know, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:06.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you the one \Nwho killed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:11.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:15.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, makes no difference to me if you think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:17.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would you do \Nsomething like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:21.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why have you come this far \Nto save your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al is my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:28.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're ready for this, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.21,0:14:33.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is Al? Give him the hell \Nback to me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:36.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want me to return him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.41,0:14:37.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:47.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.53,0:14:48.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:58.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:01.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that all the resolve \Nyou've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:06.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Correct me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.71,0:15:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm an error, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you before, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to defeat me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:19.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...then fight with the intent to kill you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:22.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:30.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's my mechanic for you. \NEven like this, I can still move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.71,0:15:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:46.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That didn't hurt one bit, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:53.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time, it's... {\i1}my{\i0} turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:15.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell \Ndid you do to my shield?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.14,0:16:17.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you think about it, \Nit's pretty simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:19.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't create something \Nout of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.74,0:16:23.96,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,In other words, you've got to be fashioning that shield thing of yours from someplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:27.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though you're a homunculus,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:30.21,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,they say that the components of your body \Nare still the same, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:32.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The substance within \Nyour body's composition
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:37.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that can be converted into \Na very hard, durable material...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.39,0:16:41.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's what comprises \Na third of your body: carbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:45.82,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,The hardness changes depending on \Nhow the carbon atoms have been arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.82,0:16:50.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From pencil leads \Nall the way up to diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.69,0:16:54.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once I know the structure, \Nthe rest is right up my alley!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:04.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.51,0:17:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't lost yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.73,0:17:10.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This fight is over, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:13.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You heard from your brother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:15.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't die all that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:21.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'll just have to hammer you until you decide you want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.93,0:17:26.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it! It wouldn't be fun \Nany other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:28.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's the kid I was hoping for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.47,0:17:40.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:42.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:07.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nicely... done...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:22.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Al? \NWhere did you take Al?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I let him go \Na long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:27.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:32.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Homunculi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:37.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are born when you alchemists \Nperform human transmutations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.04,0:18:40.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:44.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,brought before the bones of the person they attempted to bring back to life,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we aren't able to move freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:52.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is the homunculi's \NAchilles' heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why? Why are you \Ntelling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.67,0:18:57.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Knowing you, \Nyou can defeat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:19:02.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't bear to let myself be sealed up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.99,0:19:04.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed... are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.96,0:19:07.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am avarice, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:10.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will do with my life as I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.71,0:19:14.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:18.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Defeat... them...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:21.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm counting... on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:40.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey... you're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:43.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.64,0:19:48.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! \NAre you screwing with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.37,0:19:51.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I could knock your head off \Nand you wouldn't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:53.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:15.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:35.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:37.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:02.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did my teacher say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:06.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. By the time I got here, she was already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.21,0:21:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know where \NLyra went off to, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.80,0:21:18.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, I really am \Nsorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:21.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:26.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we stayed by your side any longer, Sensei, we'd just be in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.84,0:21:30.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, there's a possibility \Nthat the military is after you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.61,0:21:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so could I ask you to go into hiding for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.45,0:21:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of all the... If it's come to me being worried over by you, then it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going, \Nno matter what I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:45.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, \Nwe will continue our journey
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.94,0:21:48.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,until we get our own bodies back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:52.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:54.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.11,0:23:41.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.11,0:23:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 35: "Fool's Reunion"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.32,0:23:48.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where do we come from, and where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.40,0:23:52.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are those the questions of a fool?
